Defining all hooks...
@newcmd __m2_begin_hook
(m2 begin hook) FILE='@__FILE__@', DEPTH=@__DEPTH__@
@endcmd
@@
@newcmd __file_open_hook
(file open hook) FILE='@__FILE__@', DEPTH=@__DEPTH__@
@endcmd
@@
@newcmd __file_suspend_hook
(file suspend hook) FILE='@__FILE__@', DEPTH=@__DEPTH__@
@endcmd
@@
@newcmd __file_resume_hook
(file resume hook) FILE='@__FILE__@', DEPTH=@__DEPTH__@
@endcmd
@@
@newcmd __file_close_hook
(file close hook) FILE='@__FILE__@', DEPTH=@__DEPTH__@
@endcmd
@@
@newcmd __m2_end_hook
(m2 end hook) FILE='@__FILE__@', DEPTH=@__DEPTH__@
@endcmd
